            "review_title": "Review at Phở Cường Cơm Hà Nội",
            "review_text": "Nguyễn Thanh Tuấn\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat Food & Excellent Service!\nMar 2025 • Friends\nI recently had a trip to Da Nang. Around noon, after some sightseeing, I went looking for a place to eat. I accidentally found this restaurant. At first, I just went in to have a quick meal without expecting much. But as soon as I stepped inside, I was really surprised. The space was spacious and clean. The food was absolutely delicious (according to my taste). The staff was very friendly, attentive, and always dedicated to serving customers. I must say, it was an amazing experience!\nWritten March 26, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
