            "review_text": "ndndn\n1 contribution\n0\nSeafood Noodle Soup – Fresh & Full of Flavor!\nMar 2025 • Family\nAs a seafood lover, I couldn’t resist trying Seafood Noodle Soup, and it was outstanding! The broth was light yet packed with seafood essence, and the shrimp and squid were incredibly fresh. The staff was friendly and explained the ingredients, making it an enjoyable experience. A great spot for anyone craving fresh Vietnamese seafood!\nWritten March 24, 2025",
