            "review_text": "Connector09429981430\n1 contribution\n0\nA Hidden Gem of Central Vietnam\nMar 2025 • Family\nI had never heard of Mì Quảng before coming to Da Nang, but after trying it here, I wonder why it’s not more famous! The thick turmeric-infused noodles, the crunchy peanuts, and the fragrant broth – everything was perfect. The prawns were super fresh, and the crispy rice crackers added a nice texture. If you want to try something uniquely Central Vietnamese, this dish is a must!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 23, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
